## Version Information

```bash
ruby.com --version
# ruby 3.4.7 (2025-10-08 revision 7a5688e2a2) +PRISM [x86_64-linux]

gem.com --version
# 3.6.9

gem.com list | grep bundler
# bundler (default: 2.6.9)
```

## Technical Details

**Architecture**: Actually Portable Executable (APE) format
**Stdlib**: Embedded in ZIP filesystem at `/zip/lib/ruby/3.4.0/`
**Gems**: Embedded in ZIP filesystem at `/zip/lib/ruby/gems/3.4.0/`
**Binary Size**: ~50MB (includes full stdlib and 24 gems)

**Build System**: Cosmopolitan's BUILD.mk (not GNU Make)
**Linking**: Static (no dynamic libraries)
**Parser**: Prism (modern Ruby parser)
**Threading**: pthread (full thread/ractor support)

## Differences from Standard Ruby

1. **No dynamic loading**: Extensions statically linked, marked with `rb_provide()`
2. **No YJIT/RJIT**: JIT disabled for portability
3. **errno wrapper**: Compile-time constants for Cosmopolitan compatibility
4. **Socket constants**: Compile-time wrapper for switch statements
5. **Hardcoded generated files**: Some build artifacts committed to source

